{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "g-main",
			"type": "group",
			"x": -2700,
			"y": -700,
			"width": 4400,
			"height": 560,
			"label": "Main spine: from data to a usable stationary model",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "g-diagnostics",
			"type": "group",
			"x": -950,
			"y": 80,
			"width": 3000,
			"height": 860,
			"label": "Diagnostic branches: what the model failure tells you",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "g-nonstationary",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 2050,
			"y": -700,
			"width": 3000,
			"height": 1280,
			"label": "Alternate route: when stationarity fails",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "g-chapters",
			"type": "group",
			"x": -2700,
			"y": 1180,
			"width": 5200,
			"height": 520,
			"label": "Chapter anchors: original course notes remain the source of truth",
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "title",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -2700,
			"y": -1160,
			"width": 900,
			"height": 280,
			"text": "# Time Series Course Atlas\n\nBig Picture version.\n\n目标不是列出所有卡片，而是在一眼内读出：这门课如何从“能不能建模”走到“该用哪类模型”。",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "reading-rule",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -1650,
			"y": -1160,
			"width": 1050,
			"height": 280,
			"text": "## How to read\n\n先读中间主线，再看分叉：\n\n- 主线：平稳单变量 -> ARMA -> 诊断 -> 预测\n- 橙色分叉：方差结构 -> ARCH/GARCH\n- 蓝色分叉：多变量传导 -> ADL/VAR\n- 红色分叉：非平稳 -> 单位根/协整/ECM",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "start",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -2600,
			"y": -580,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 260,
			"text": "## Start: what series and what task?\n\n来源：[[00_导论与概率论复习]] · [[01_介绍时间序列]]\n\n先明确变量、频率、目标：解释、预测、政策冲击，还是变量传导。这里还不是选模型。",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "gate",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -1950,
			"y": -580,
			"width": 500,
			"height": 260,
			"text": "## Gate: can I treat it as stationary?\n\n来源：[[Stationarity]] · [[Unit Root Test]]\n\n这是整门课最重要的分叉。若可平稳处理，进入 ARMA；若失败，转向趋势、单位根和协整。",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "grammar",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -1260,
			"y": -580,
			"width": 470,
			"height": 260,
			"text": "## Dynamic grammar\n\n来源：[[02_差分方程Difference Equation]] · [[Lag Operator]] · [[Difference Equation]]\n\n差分方程和滞后算子提供“动态系统会收敛、发散还是单位根”的底层语法。",
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "arma",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -610,
			"y": -580,
			"width": 500,
			"height": 260,
			"text": "## Baseline model: ARMA mean equation\n\n来源：[[03_平稳时间序列模型]] · [[ARMA]]\n\n当序列可被平稳处理时，ARMA 是默认基准：先解释均值动态，再看残差是否干净。",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "loop",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 100,
			"y": -580,
			"width": 560,
			"height": 260,
			"text": "## Identify -> estimate -> diagnose\n\n来源：[[Autocorrelation Function]] · [[Partial Autocorrelation Function]] · [[ARMA Model Identification Steps]] · [[AIC]] · [[BIC]] · [[White Noise Test]]\n\nACF/PACF 提候选，信息准则做取舍，白噪声检验决定模型是否还漏结构。",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "forecast",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 900,
			"y": -580,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 260,
			"text": "## If clean: forecast and compare\n\n来源：[[Forecast Evaluation]] · [[Diebold-Mariano Test]]\n\n残差足够干净后，模型才进入预测和模型比较；否则要回到诊断分叉。",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "mean-fail",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -820,
			"y": 210,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 230,
			"text": "## Branch A: residual still autocorrelated\n\n来源：[[White Noise Test]] · [[Box-Jenkins Method]]\n\n说明均值方程还没讲完：回到 ARMA 阶数、差分、或模型设定。",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "var-fail",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -180,
			"y": 210,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 230,
			"text": "## Branch B: squared residual has structure\n\n来源：[[ARCH LM Test]] · [[McLeod-Li Test]]\n\n均值残差可以没自相关，但平方残差仍有自相关。这说明问题转向条件方差。",
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "garch",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 540,
			"y": 210,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 230,
			"text": "## Volatility layer: ARCH/GARCH\n\n来源：[[04_波动建模 Modeling Volatility]] · [[ARCH]] · [[GARCH]] · [[Conditional Heteroskedasticity]]\n\n这不是推翻 ARMA，而是在均值模型之后给方差再建一层动态结构。",
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "multi-trigger",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -820,
			"y": 610,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 230,
			"text": "## Branch C: more than one variable matters\n\n来源：[[05_多方程模型Multi-equation Time Series Models]]\n\n如果问题不再是一条序列自身，而是变量之间的滞后传导，进入多方程区。",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "adl-var",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -180,
			"y": 610,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 230,
			"text": "## ADL / VAR system\n\n来源：[[ADL]] · [[Transfer Function Model]] · [[VAR Model]]\n\nADL 强调外生输入如何传到 y；VAR 把多个变量放进同一个动态系统。",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "transmission",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 540,
			"y": 610,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 230,
			"text": "## Explain transmission\n\n来源：[[Impulse Response Function]] · [[Granger Causality Test]] · [[Variance Decomposition]]\n\n这一区的结果不是单个系数，而是冲击路径、预测方向和误差贡献。",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "nonstart",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 2180,
			"y": -580,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 250,
			"text": "## If the gate fails: nonstationary route\n\n来源：[[06_含趋势的模型]] · [[Random Walk]]\n\n当平稳性门槛过不去，课程切换问题：该去趋势、差分，还是保留长期关系？",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "unitroot",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 2890,
			"y": -580,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 250,
			"text": "## Trend vs unit root\n\n来源：[[Unit Root Test]] · [[Augmented Dickey-Fuller Test]] · [[KPSS Test]]\n\n先判断非平稳来自确定性趋势，还是随机趋势/单位根。处理方式完全不同。",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "spurious",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 3600,
			"y": -580,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 250,
			"text": "## Danger: spurious regression\n\n来源：[[Spurious Regression]]\n\n两个非平稳序列直接回归，可能得到漂亮但虚假的显著性。这里是警告牌。",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "single-non",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 2540,
			"y": -180,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 240,
			"text": "## Single series path: difference / ARIMA\n\n来源：[[First Difference]] · [[ARIMA]]\n\n如果只处理单变量，常见路线是差分后回到 ARMA 思路。",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "cointegration",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 3240,
			"y": -180,
			"width": 560,
			"height": 240,
			"text": "## Multiple I(1) variables: ask cointegration\n\n来源：[[07_协整和误差修正模型]] · [[Cointegration]] · [[Common Stochastic Trend]]\n\n多个 I(1) 变量不一定只能差分；若线性组合平稳，长期关系本身就是信息。",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "ecm",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 3980,
			"y": -180,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 240,
			"text": "## If cointegrated: ECM / system tests\n\n来源：[[Error Correction Model]] · [[Engle-Granger Two-Step Test]] · [[Johansen Cointegration Test]]\n\n协整之后不只看长期方程，还要用 ECM/VECM 描述短期如何回到长期均衡。",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "ch00",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -2600,
			"y": 1280,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 230,
			"text": "## 00\n\n[[00_导论与概率论复习]]\n\n概率和统计语言",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "ch01",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -2050,
			"y": 1280,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 230,
			"text": "## 01\n\n[[01_介绍时间序列]]\n\n课程对象和四块主线",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "ch02",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -1500,
			"y": 1280,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 230,
			"text": "## 02\n\n[[02_差分方程Difference Equation]]\n\n动态系统语法",
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "ch03",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -950,
			"y": 1280,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 230,
			"text": "## 03\n\n[[03_平稳时间序列模型]]\n\nARMA 主干",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "ch04",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -400,
			"y": 1280,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 230,
			"text": "## 04\n\n[[04_波动建模 Modeling Volatility]]\n\nARCH/GARCH",
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "ch05",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 150,
			"y": 1280,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 230,
			"text": "## 05\n\n[[05_多方程模型Multi-equation Time Series Models]]\n\nADL/VAR",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "ch06",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 700,
			"y": 1280,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 230,
			"text": "## 06\n\n[[06_含趋势的模型]]\n\n趋势和单位根",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "ch07",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1250,
			"y": 1280,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 230,
			"text": "## 07\n\n[[07_协整和误差修正模型]]\n\n协整和 ECM",
			"color": "1"
		}
	],
